OL,3,GNEWSAPlans lodged for car park near
OL,4,Anature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new 20-space car park could soon be
OL,7,Finstalled at a Surrey nature spot and
OL,8,Ffishing lake in a bid to ease parking
OL,9,Fpressure on nearby residential streets.
OL,11,FPlans have been submitted to Spelthorne
OL,12,FBorough Council to create a dedicated
OL,13,Fcar park serving Church Lammas Lake
OL,14,Fvisitors and authorised members of the
OL,15,Ffishery.
OL,17,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,18,FReporting Service, planning documents
OL,19,Fsay the proposals would resolve
OL,20,F"long-standing parking issues".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
