OL,3,GNEWSAPlans lodged for car park near
OL,4,Anature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe documents state: "Church Lammas
OL,7,FLake has historically attracted
OL,8,Frecreational anglers... due to the
OL,9,Fabsence of dedicated off-road parking
OL,10,Ffacilities, visitors have regularly
OL,11,Fparked on surrounding residential
OL,12,Froads."
